"▷ Then where does the ash you use now come from?",
"…We are sparing what was scraped together a thousand years ago. There were seven jars in the Order's storeroom. Half a jar is left. When it runs out, I can write names but I can no longer keep them. That spear is… the only one of that fire that remains.",
"The machine's printout",
"The paper the Harbinger spat out. It was reckoned a thousand years ago, and yet it speaks of us. Down to the date.",
"\"Those who hold the ember arrive on the seventeenth ship.\" It's true. Haru's ledger says seventeen ships.",
